WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.270
- So, why did former President
Trump's impeachment lawyers

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:03.630
all leave en masse?

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.030
And why can't he just just use Rudy?

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.220
Well, Rudy is a material
witness to this impeachment.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.550
Jay Sekulow was too smart to ruin himself

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:10.780
over this particular impeachment,

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.390
though he was fine in
the last impeachment.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.510
Well, it seems like the real problem

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.650
is that real lawyers don't like to lie,

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.490
either to courts or to Congress,

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.250
and they're worried
about their reputation.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.020
Former President Trump is basically toxic

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.980
over the Capitol insurrection,

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.030
and it seems like Trump
wants to focus on this

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.130
as his primary defense,

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:29.070
that he was justified in making
all these crazy statements,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.290
and these lawyers just aren't
going to put up with that,

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.750
whether it's for their reputation

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.330
or because it's completely illegal.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:35.247
So, I know what you're thinking,

00:00:35.247 --> 00:00:38.640
"Hopefully, President Trump
will represent himself, YOLO!"

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.713
So, subscribe, or I'll see you in court.

